      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1532ae5d489ca43",
      "translationZh": "我只是来分享一下我在 5060TI 上能跑得下的 Qwen 3.8 27b 配置。酷的是，你甚至还能用上视觉功能！而且有 85K 的上下文（我还剩 1.5gb 的余量，可以用来增加上下文长度，或者换成质量更好的量化版本）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "592ec975b0988e76",
      "translationZh": "模型：IQ3_XXS-mtp，来自 https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-27B-GSQ-RCO-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef25706180db208b",
      "translationZh": "使用 beellama https://github.com/Anbeeld/beellama.cpp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5300f46f1b9de23c",
      "translationZh": "我做到了 decode 阶段 45tks，prefill 阶段大约 300。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f4842ef0a42fb32",
      "translationZh": "没错，用的是 kvarn4，但效果也没那么差，看看：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27fb4ad24f13ba34",
      "translationZh": "我也知道，可以把 mmproj 移到 cpu 上，从而腾出更多 vram。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
